### create user 1

POST http://localhost:3000/session HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "name": "matt"
}

### create user 2

POST http://localhost:3000/session HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "name": "lachi"
}

### create user 3

POST http://localhost:3000/session HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "name": "eros"
}

### new chat

POST http://localhost:3000/users/1/conversations HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: 1

{
    "name": "Calcetto",
    "members": [{ "id": 1, "name": "matt" }, {"id": 2, "name": "lachita"}]
}

### change name

PUT http://localhost:3000/users/2/name HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: 2

{
    "name": "lachitha"
}

### leave group 1

DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/1/groups/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: 1

### leave group 2

DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/2/groups/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### getMyConvs

GET http://localhost:3000/users/1/conversations HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: 1

### getConv 1

GET http://localhost:3000/users/1/conversations/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: 1

### addToGroup 3

PUT  http://localhost:3000/users/1/groups/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: 1

{
    "id": 3,
    "name": "eros"
}

### setNameGroup 1

PUT  http://localhost:3000/users/1/groups/1/name HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: 1

{
    "name": "calcetto di natale"
}

### sendMessage

POST  http://localhost:3000/users/1/conversations/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: 1

{
    "content": "Domani va bene"
}

### forwardMessage

POST  http://localhost:3000/users/2/conversations/1/message/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: 2

{
    "id": "1"
}

### deleteMessage

DELETE  http://localhost:3000/users/1/conversations/1/message/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: 1

### commentMessage

PUT  http://localhost:3000/users/1/conversations/1/message/2/comment HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: 1

{
    "content": "😁"
}

### uncommentMessage

DELETE  http://localhost:3000/users/1/conversations/1/message/2/comment HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: 1

### setMyPhoto

PUT  http://localhost:3000/users/1/picture HTTP/1.1
Authorization: 1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=--WebKitFormBoundary

----WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="profilepic.jpeg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./profilepic.jpeg
----WebKitFormBoundary--

### setGroupPhoto

PUT  http://localhost:3000/users/1/groups/1/picture HTTP/1.1
Authorization: 1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=--WebKitFormBoundary

----WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="grouppic.jpeg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./grouppic.jpg
----WebKitFormBoundary--